OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze in
OL,4,Afourth floor tenement flat in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a blaze which
OL,7,Ftook hold in a fourth floor tenement
OL,8,Fflat in the north of Glasgow.
OL,10,FSix fire engines and specialist
OL,11,Fresources were sent to Stonyhurst
OL,12,FStreet in Possilpark at about 16:50.
OL,14,FPictures posted on social media show
OL,15,Fflames emerging from the roof of a
OL,16,Fbuilding which was covered in
OL,17,Fscaffolding. NG Homes was in the
OL,18,Fprocess of refurbishing and upgrading a
OL,19,Fnumber of buildings on the street.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
